Declare `extern u32 D_0040E618[];` and use D_0040E618[-1]. Writing &D_0040E618 - 4 (or a scalar extern) makes GCC fold to D_0040E610+4 and the relocation/encoding differs (score ~1295 vs 120). Loading cap before begin is what makes middle blocks schedule `lw $v0,cap` into the branch delay slot exactly like the ROM.

